+UNCONDITIONAL STRATEGIES
+- A strategy is allowed to contain no conditional rules.
+- If the student gives one unconditional behavior such as «همیشه دنبال توپ برو», represent it as rules=[] and put that action in default_action.
+- Example: «همیشه دنبال توپ برو» -> rules=[] and default_action="MOVE_TO_BALL".
+- Do NOT invent a fake condition just to create a rule.
+- An empty rules list is valid when default_action exactly represents the student's unconditional behavior.
